    <title>On the boat to Cartagena, Colombia</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/node/4103</link>
    <description>&lt;div class=&quot;flickrfloat&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://www.stahlratte.org/uploads/RTEmagicC_unter_segeln.jpg.jpg&quot; /&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;caption&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;The Stahlratte&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
Tomorrow we take a 4-wheel-drive to Carti on the Caribbean coast, load our bikes and gear aboard, and spend 5 days on &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.stahlratte.org/index.php?id=28&amp;L=1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;the Stahlratte&lt;/a&gt; sailing through the San Blas Islands and on to Cartagena, Colombia. We&#039;re excited about the trip, and anxious about the next phase of the trip... South America! Will the climbs kill us? Will we be kidnapped by terrorists (probably not)? Do we have another year of travel and another 10,000 miles in us? Stay tuned...</description>
